              "id": "fda50aa8-6f65-497d-9b8a-ee775750366b",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Games of the World</strong></em> was written by Frederic V. Grunfeld, originally published by the Ballantine Books, September 12, 1977."
            },
            {
              "id": "b52f1e3f-40ec-41dc-9d52-90a9be7d3883",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "03a0a365-98a9-4534-941e-604b219723ae",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>A crafts book! A sports book! A history book! The fun and excitement of a world at play - beautifully described and lavishly illustrated. How to make them. How to play them. How they came to be.</em>"
            },
